      "value": "Its been like this for 3 weeks now and it has gotten worse. I have to reload, restart, and log back in just to make it work for a Short time. Even then it will still brake and Be so bad that it crashes evthing forcing a shutdown, At one point it even Killed my phone it was that bad. And yes i checked Everything On settings and then some to Make sure it wasn't on my end, i even had A friend on pc and Headset check and they said it's not user error it is the game and platform itself Literally killing its code. I can understand it being beta but Oh my God for this to have gotten This bad in 3 weeks is unacceptable. Oh and before you say \"get a pc get a headset\" Not everyone can aford those some of us are stuck with mobile and only mobile.",
