      "value": "@{6a0630cacf565b8f741eda2b|full_name} ohhhh, as a regular user looking at the bug tracker I only see the body of your post, so no information like what version or platform the bug is applicable to. You mentioned mobile, and I'm wondering if you're on an iPhone or Android. \n\nAny time I hear about people playing vrchat on a phone, I'm surprised it works as well as it does, at least without a lot of intervention from vrchat. \n\nI'm even more surprised they got it on iOS.\n\nFor better or worse, vrchat isn't restricting where mobile players can go. If they really wanted a better experience, they'd probably curate what worlds and possibly what avatars are accessible to mobile users. Like the game might work better in optimized box, but who really wants to hang out only there?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
