      "value": "@{62df7cd83e007e467295c4e1|full_name}\n\nI am on Mobile, and i do agree it is very surprising that it works. Though i would like for them to fix the current situation of bugs that had been bombarding users for a while.\n\nAs for the worlds they lack in accessibility with interaction of objects in the worlds, it would be nice to be able to play games properly and not be limited to what we can interact with.\n\nWith mobile exclusive games no one wants to keep in them, they are not fun and no one wants to hang out there lol.",
